    "description": "At Hive, we have built a technology and services platform to enable every organization, small and large, to do more with the power of AI. Our platform solves critical problems facing businesses and industries that were previously intractable either due to high cost or insufficient technical capability. Hive is the industry\u2019s \u200bfirst full-stack AI platform, offering solutions ranging from data labeling to model development to application development. We have developed advanced capabilities in object detection, facial recognition, transcription, and many other areas.\r\n\r\nUse this demo to see a small sample of what our AI platform is capable of.",
